{
  "duration": 63.715375,
  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.92,
      "text": "How can you ask a useful question about the selected workload?"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.04,
      "end": 9.7,
      "text": "Open Ask EMOS and ask about evidence, dependencies, modernization options, or the"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.7,
      "end": 10.72,
      "text": "next governed step."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.72,
      "end": 14.32,
      "text": "Ask EMOS is an interface, not a third specialist."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.100000000000001,
      "end": 19.98,
      "text": "A deterministic orchestrator routes the request to Portfolio Discovery, Enterprise"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.98,
      "end": 23.42,
      "text": "Architect, or both, using the current context."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.42,
      "end": 27.76,
      "text": "Portfolio Discovery investigates ambiguity and evidence gaps."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.68,
      "end": 32.28,
      "text": "Enterprise Architect reasons across the six R choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.22,
      "end": 41.22,
      "text": "Deterministic validation and governance check the response, and explicit human"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.22,
      "end": 42.92,
      "text": "approval retains authority."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.92,
      "end": 48.58,
      "text": "If AI reasoning is unavailable, EMOS labels the deterministic status and evidence"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.58,
      "end": 49.36,
      "text": "fallback."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.88,
      "end": 52.14,
      "text": "It does not pretend that a model answered."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.84,
      "end": 54.42,
      "text": "Agents for ambiguity."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.38,
      "end": 57.059999999999995,
      "text": "Workflows for predictability."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.92,
      "end": 58.8,
      "text": "Rules for governance."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.84,
      "end": 60.839999999999996,
      "text": "Humans for authority."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.68000000000001,
      "end": 63.74,
      "text": "Next, ask what evidence is missing."
    }
  ],
